    Vendor VINTF manifest sun — myron (POCO F8 Ultra / SM8850 sun)
    Mirror of manifest.xml for sun platform compatibility.
    Confirmed from: device/qcom/sun/manifest_sun.xml (stock)
    
    REMOVED: HIDL android.hardware.keymaster@4.1 stub (no binary, causes VINTF reject)
